  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Changed\n- Dependencies - Updated Nullable.Extended.Analyzer to 1.17.1\n- EnableConfigurationBindingGenerator=true is now required on packable or publishable projects, and EnableMicrosoftExtensionsConfigurationBinderSourceGenerator (which no package reads) is now rejected in every project\n### Deployment Changes\n- Before upgrading, replace <EnableMicrosoftExtensionsConfigurationBinderSourceGenerator>true</EnableMicrosoftExtensionsConfigurationBinderSourceGenerator> with <EnableConfigurationBindingGenerator>true</EnableConfigurationBindingGenerator> in every project; set IsPublishable=false on projects that are not packable or executables to skip the check",
